claim.claim-text:
an outer shell (54) comprising an interior lumen (58) configured to contain a drug (62);
a region of drug release (56) at a first end of the outer shell (54), the region of drug release comprising an orifice (56a, 56b);
a retention means (359); and
a permeable or semi-permeable material disposed within the outer shell (54) and positioned between the interior lumen (58) configured to contain the drug (62) and the orifice (56a, 56b).
